<title>USA: Camco Financial Corp Q3 net loss.</title>
<headline>Camco Financial Corp Q3 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Ohio 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $0.15   profit	 $0.56</p>
<p> Net     loss		 307   profit	 1,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,073		    2,070</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 includes an after-tax charge of $1.2 million of $0.58 per share for recapitalizing the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>The bank said nine-month net income was $3 million or $1.44 per share before the SAIF charge.</p>
</text>
